{
  "_doc": [
    "Vehicles v2 roster (PLAN wave A4): one entry per uploaded car model. build_roster.py runs carpipe on each source",
    "(assets/source/sketchfab/<source>/model.glb in the main checkout, see docs/v2/sourcing/PICKS.md) with `config`",
    "merged over `_defaults`, into assets/vehicles/<id>/. gen_vehicles.py turns the sidecars + this file + the upload",
    "manifest into src/shared/Config/Vehicles.luau. Names are our own parody brands: never real brands, never GTA names",
    "(no Phoenix, Cheetah, Burrito, Dukes, Infernus, Banshee, Stallion, Taxi brands...). body: 'paint' = recolourable",
    "(strip route: MeshPart.Color; tintmask route: the overlay PNG as TextureID with the paint showing through),",
    "'livery' = the baked body texture as TextureID (police / taxi / service liveries keep their artwork)."
  ],
  "_defaults": {
    "roles": {"Carbadges|_badges?_|badges_badges": "Discard"},
    "length": "auto"
  },
